{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b7e1c2d4-9a3f-4c8e-b5d6-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
		"name": "Kong4 Gateway — ONE Cash APIs",
		"description": "Postman collection for all APIs exposed by the Kong4 DB-less Kong gateway (port 8000).\n\nGenerated from `kong.yml` (services + routes) and the custom plugins in `plugins/`:\n\n| Service | Route(s) | Plugin |\n|---|---|---|\n| customer-svc | `/NWC/*` | passport-router (routes North/South by Redis passport) |\n| agent-svc | `/AGENT/*` | passport-router |\n| payment-svc | `/payment/transfer` | payment-transfer (North debit → South credit with reversal) |\n| dual-login-svc | `/login2`, `/auth/login2` | dual-login |\n| identity-svc | `/NWC/rest/Login`, `/NWC/rest/register`, `/NWC/rest/identity/check` | identity-matrix |\n| switch-svc | `/switch/*` + `/NWC/rest/switch/*`, `/NWC/rest/register/second-account` | switch-account |\n\n**Common headers**\n- `X-MSISDN` — customer phone number (required by most plugins)\n- `X-Device-Id` — device hardware/app UUID\n- `X-Target-Region` — `NORTH` or `SOUTH`\n- `X-Transaction-Id` — optional idempotency key for payment transfers\n\nSwitchAccount error codes: `SW_001`..`SW_008`, registration codes `REG-ID-*`, idempotency `PIN-017`. See `SWITCH_ACCOUNT_DOCUMENTATION.md`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "kong4"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "msisdn",
			"value": "967700000001",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "deviceId",
			"value": "DEVICE-IPHONE-14",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "targetRegion",
			"value": "SOUTH",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "amount",
			"value": "100",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "currency",
			"value": "USD",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Customer — /NWC (customer-svc, passport-router)",
			"description": "Customer wallet APIs. The `passport-router` plugin (priority 900) reads the Redis passport `passport:<X-MSISDN>`, resolves the device default / region, and routes to `north-backend` (10.200.31.18:8080) or `south-backend` (10.200.114.22:8080). Responses are transformed per region (region fields added, internal fields/headers scrubbed).",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "X-MSISDN", "value": "{{msisdn}}" },
							{ "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"appVersion\": 18,\n  \"username\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"pass\": \"7+QEKk8L5/XLlPqLztdIng==\",\n  \"timeStp\": \"04-11-2026 23:13:04.900\",\n  \"device\": \"{{deviceId}}\",\n  \"otherinfo\": \"Xiaomi#22101316C#Redmi Note 12 Pro\",\n  \"hash\": \"5B9CDE4F4F2947129ABD9306EF600054EE859B0DD264690D9A5C5A0805174615\",\n  \"otp\": null,\n  \"rot\": 0,\n  \"dvir\": 1,\n  \"userId\": null\n}",
							"options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/NWC/rest/Login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["NWC", "rest", "Login"]
						},
						"description": "Customer login via `/NWC/rest/Login`. Guarded by `identity-matrix` (priority 950) then routed by `passport-router`. Body shape matches the sample payload in `plugins/dual-login/south_payload.json`."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "X-MSISDN", "value": "{{msisdn}}" },
							{ "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"device\": \"{{deviceId}}\",\n  \"appVersion\": 18\n}",
							"options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/NWC/rest/register",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["NWC", "rest", "register"]
						},
						"description": "First-account registration. `identity-matrix` enforces registration guards (missing `X-MSISDN` → `REG-ID-001`), then the request is routed to the region backend."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Identity Check (pre-check)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "X-MSISDN", "value": "{{msisdn}}" },
							{ "key": "X-Target-Region", "value": "{{targetRegion}}" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/NWC/rest/identity/check",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["NWC", "rest", "identity", "check"]
						},
						"description": "Identity pre-check endpoint guarded by `identity-matrix`. `X-Target-Region` selects NORTH/SOUTH."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Generic NWC passthrough",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "X-MSISDN", "value": "{{msisdn}}" },
							{ "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"example\": \"any /NWC/** path is forwarded with strip_path=false\"\n}",
							"options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/NWC/rest/your-backend-endpoint",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["NWC", "rest", "your-backend-endpoint"]
						},
						"description": "Any other `/NWC/**` path is forwarded as-is to the region backend chosen by `passport-router`. Edit the path to hit a specific backend endpoint (balance, transfers, etc.)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
